{"id":1506,"title":"什么Python中的负索引？","summary":"什么Python中的负索引？","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"dd710dca-e500-347c-8505-31b2c48e2771","knowledge_id":188,"title":"什么Python中的负索引？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":188,"title":"什么Python中的负索引？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"70265bfc-0665-3f68-8979-b75c28cb1c8d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"元素的索引是该元素在任何可迭代对象中的位置(从**0**开始)。\n\n比如列表`[1, 2, 3]`，那么元素**1** 的索引就是 **0**。这是因为在 Python 中，索引以 **0** 开始。\n\n同样，Python 也支持负索引。负索引以 **-1** 开始，引用对象的最后一个元素。\n\n例如，如果 list 是 `[1,2,3]`，那么元素 **3** 的负索引是 **-1,**，元素 **2** 的索引是 **-2**。","text_html":"<p>元素的索引是该元素在任何可迭代对象中的位置(从<strong>0</strong>开始)。</p>\n<p>比如列表<code>[1, 2, 3]</code>，那么元素<strong>1</strong> 的索引就是 <strong>0</strong>。这是因为在 Python 中，索引以 <strong>0</strong> 开始。</p>\n<p>同样，Python 也支持负索引。负索引以 <strong>-1</strong> 开始，引用对象的最后一个元素。</p>\n<p>例如，如果 list 是 <code>[1,2,3]</code>，那么元素 <strong>3</strong> 的负索引是 **-1,**，元素 <strong>2</strong> 的索引是 <strong>-2</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"52d6d380-7983-31bd-9d2e-7c520d3da1ce","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"lst = ['h', 'e', 'l', 'l', 'o']\n\n# 正索引\nprint(lst[0])  # h\nprint(lst[3])  # l\n\n# 负索引\nprint(lst[-1])  # o\nprint(lst[-4])  # e","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"027","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/027/page/1506"}
